        "description": "Minecraft Toolkit map renderer palette: curated average colors per block id. Keys are vanilla block names WITHOUT the 'minecraft:' namespace prefix, lowercase (matching how the region parser normalizes palette entries). Values are #RRGGBB approximations of the block's top face.",
