            "water is special-cased in McToolkit\\Services\\Maps\\RegionParser for the documented 0.6 blend; the entry here only feeds that blend color.",
            "Fully transparent blocks (air variants, glass) are intentionally ABSENT from this table so the column walker keeps looking beneath them.",
            "Unknown ids fall back to RegionParser::UNKNOWN_BLOCK_COLOR."
        ],
        "license": "original reconstruction - approximate hand-picked values, no Mojang assets embedded",
        "version": 1
    },
